{"3665540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Loot Scoot", "steam_appid": 3665540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two crews, one lively city, and a whole lot of “whaaat ?!” In LootScoot, Thieves sprint for big payouts while Cops try to shut the show down. With gadgets, teamwork, and a dose of chaos. It’s bright, cheeky, and built for quick, replayable matches where every corner can flip the script.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/extras/5fef26cca93848ce318777148202af63.avif?t=1769841634\" width=1560 height=636 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thieves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak into shops, grab the cash, and deliver it to a hidden contact before the sirens catch up. Bigger hauls paint a bigger target—so plan your route, use disguises, and let your friends create “accidental” distractions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol hot spots, read the map, and pounce on suspicious movement. Box in suspects, cut off escape lanes, and coordinate takedowns to keep the streets in one piece (more or less).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How You Win</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves win by hitting the cash goal before the timer runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cops win if the clock hits zero and the thieves come up short, late game helicopters make hiding a lot harder.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE NEED YOU !! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/extras/0946f1f991b1f122af00d30e1e374b73.avif?t=1769841634\" width=1512 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Boss:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Think fast, look normal, and bring home something shiny. My crew loves a generous rookie.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheriff:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Badge up, rookie. The city’s loud, the streets are wild, and we’re here to make it a good day.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a side, grab your friends, and dive into a playful cops-and-robbers sprint where every match tells a new “you had to be there” story.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two crews, one lively city, and a whole lot of “whaaat ?!” In LootScoot, Thieves sprint for big payouts while Cops try to shut the show down. With gadgets, teamwork, and a dose of chaos. It’s bright, cheeky, and built for quick, replayable matches where every corner can flip the script.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/extras/5fef26cca93848ce318777148202af63.avif?t=1769841634\" width=1560 height=636 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thieves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak into shops, grab the cash, and deliver it to a hidden contact before the sirens catch up. Bigger hauls paint a bigger target—so plan your route, use disguises, and let your friends create “accidental” distractions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrol hot spots, read the map, and pounce on suspicious movement. Box in suspects, cut off escape lanes, and coordinate takedowns to keep the streets in one piece (more or less).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How You Win</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves win by hitting the cash goal before the timer runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cops win if the clock hits zero and the thieves come up short, late game helicopters make hiding a lot harder.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WE NEED YOU !! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/extras/0946f1f991b1f122af00d30e1e374b73.avif?t=1769841634\" width=1512 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Boss:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Think fast, look normal, and bring home something shiny. My crew loves a generous rookie.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheriff:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Badge up, rookie. The city’s loud, the streets are wild, and we’re here to make it a good day.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a side, grab your friends, and dive into a playful cops-and-robbers sprint where every match tells a new “you had to be there” story.</p>", "short_description": "LootScoot is a fast, team-based cops-and-robbers game. Thieves break into shops and deliver cash; Cops patrol, chase, and arrest. Beat the clock with chaotic plays or go stealth and slip past patrols. Pick a side, outsmart the other, and sprint for the win.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/ee715f7c0b6a8d20dbea6062040ea986f9ae1fa6/header.jpg?t=1769841634", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/597925d2be1241bb6d6073ef767ef7d1418f88fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769841634", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665540/597925d2be1241bb6d6073ef767ef7d1418f88fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769841634", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimu